title: cm-smoke - inline-pair with block content
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

\custom corner=cb _element=div _mode=block _classes=.cb-block

!! Inline-pair fired inline, body parsed as blocks

The `❮` corner marker is invoked mid-paragraph, but its body is parsed as multiple blocks (heading, list, paragraph, nested inline).

!!! Demo

Intro text. ❮cb
!! Inline H2 inside the corner block
* item 1
* item 2

A paragraph with /° nested inline °/ in it.
❯ Trailing text after the close.

''Setup:'' the pragma at the top of this tiddler registers symbol `cb` on the corner marker with `_mode=block`. So `❮cb ... ❯` opens an inline-invoked block container.